      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jphacks/tkb_2615/git/trees/6ababc2852cb10b226295931477d0525832653ea"
    },
    "message": "Revert \"Merge pull request #268 from jphacks/perf/history-index-wal\"\n\nThis reverts commit 5b95fa2. WAL writes every index page twice, so a\nday's index commits took about twice as long and, on WSL, 10 to 15 s\nlonger in about four runs in ten, whatever the checkpoint and sync\nsettings (#269). Its gain, frame reads not waiting during a fork, comes\nup only while a fork is created.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
