    "message": "Return history indexes left in WAL mode to the rollback journal\n\nThe journal mode is kept in the file, so indexes written while #268 was\nin place stay in WAL mode after the revert. Each write now asks for the\nrollback journal; with readers open the change waits for a later write.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
